{% extends "master.twig" %}

{% block content %}
<!-- ======= travel Section ======= -->
<section id="travel" class="section-show">
    <div class="resume mt5">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Langtang National Park Trailer</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vm7PSIjrDgQ?si=6-CjJ5Ou5NiYEZLs" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p>
                            Our travel channel was started with intention of exploring different places in Nepal. Last winter we explored Langtang. It was a 7 days trek. This time we experienced magical snowfall like never before. In this travel series, we share our experience with you. 
                        </p>
                        <p>Gear Used:
Camera: Fujifilm X-T3
Lens: XF 8-16mm f/2.8 R LM WR
           XF 16-55mm f/2.8 R LM WR
           XF 50-140mm f/2.8 R LM OIS WR
           XF 35mm f/2 R WR
Drone: Mavic Air 2
Stabilizer: DJI Ronin S Gimbal
                  Manfrotto 055 Carbon Fiber, Manfrotto XPRO Magnesium Ball Head
Mic: Saramonic Blink 500 Pro B2</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="resume">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Ruby Valley Trailer</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315"
                        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/EAbfwNr6Q_8?si=Zqz5of01_PilnubJ" title="YouTube video player"
                        frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        <p>
                            
                            Our latest attempt to showcase the beauty this little country - Nepal has to offer. This time around, we ventured to a remote but surreally beautiful place called Ruby Valley. Seated on the lap of the great Ganesh Himal ranges, Ruby Valley has been a distinctly unique experience for us.
                        
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="resume mt-4">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Travels</h2>
                <p>Ruby Valley Trek | Full Video</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <iframe width="100%" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/QggEzY2LY6k?si=JpnSSA3o-B_ZeV0P"
                        title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6">
                    <div class="resume-item pb-0">
                        
                        <p>Never have we been so pleasantly surprised by such an awe-inspiring piece of landscape and the local inhabitants. We expected the usual visual highlights and the same touristic experience and hospitality but Ruby Valley managed to deliver much more than mere sightseeing. Join us to see for yourself this well-kept secret of the Himalayas.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</section>
<!-- End travel Section -->
{% endblock %}